BSP-Yocto-Ampliphy-AM62Px-PD26.1.0                2026-04-15
==========================================================

- Linux TI vendor kernel v6.12.57-11.02.11-phy6 (based on TI tag 11.02.11)
- U-Boot TI vendor v2025.01-phy6 (based on TI tag 11.02.11)
- Yocto 5.0.16 (Scarthgap)
- Qt 6.8

Tested Yocto Machines:
----------------------

- phyboard-lynx-am62pxx-1
 * phytec-headless-image/ampliphy-vendor
 * phytec-headless-bundle/ampliphy-vendor-rauc
 * phytec-headless-image/ampliphy-vendor-rt
 * phytec-qt6demo-image/ampliphy-vendor

  Build Environment:
------------------

- Ubuntu 22.04 64-bit


New in this Release
-------------------

This is the first official release for the phyCORE-AM6Px. The following interfaces are currently working:

* SD-Card
* eMMC
* SPI-Flash
* RTC
* EEPROM
* I2C
* RS232
* CAN FD
* Ethernet
* USB

**Known Issues**
^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

* **CAN FD**: CAN does not work at 125KHz.
